From: Mahmood Seoud <mahmoodseoud@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:48:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(aarshjul): replace the 349 kr. Pro door with the 1.500
 kr. done-for-you offer

Removes the Pro price block, early-access signup, board note and their
script (PRICE, door and signup handlers, pro-door events). Adds a mailto
offer card counted as service-mail-click. check-pages: Danish subjects and
events follow the new page, Pro subjects are retired, a new offer-copy rule
pins the price and copy to the offer emails, self-test mutations and the
fixture retargeted.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HPZPxM8f2XZ17g7A352ysZ
